        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVSOL19, Fifth Avenue Tall Plate with Soleil Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Fifth Avenue Tall Plate with Soleil Knob is a transitional styled knobset that is well-suited for larger doors or doors in big rooms. This 11 inch tall Fifth Avenue Plate with Soleil Knob is sure to make a bold statement. The Soleil Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate is available in many hot finish colors. Choose from standard functions like dummy, passage, and privacy door knobs. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/keyed-entry-set-soleil-knob-with-fifth-avenue-tall-plate-grandeur-favsol19entr\"><b> Soleil Knob with Fifth Avenue Plate Entryset.</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Soleil Knob with 11 Inch Fifth Avenue Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Soleil Knob with Fifth Avenue Tall Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.375\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVSOL19-specifications.pdf?v=1704262393\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur FAVSOL19 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
